## Next Steps

- The chairs (Bernie Hoeneisen and Lisa Dusseault) and AD Andy Newton will update the draft charter text to reflect the agreed amendments (adding the Architecture Document deliverable and refining the routing scope).
- Continued discussion on architectural boundaries and draft text will take place on the MTAHOOKS mailing list.
- The Responsible Area Director will evaluate the poll results and session feedback to determine next steps for working group formation.